{
  "element": "cds-progress-tracker",
  "defaults": {
    "orientation": "vertical",
    "label": "Progresso"
  },
  "jsx": {
    "tag": "ProgressTracker",
    "props": [
      {
        "prop": "orientation",
        "attr": "orientation"
      },
      {
        "prop": "aria-label",
        "attr": "label",
        "if": {
          "label": "!Progresso"
        }
      }
    ],
    "children": [
      {
        "each": "cds-progress-tracker-item",
        "node": {
          "tag": "ProgressTracker.Item",
          "defaults": {
            "status": "pending",
            "label": "Label",
            "description": "Description content",
            "show-description": "true",
            "show-link": "true",
            "link-label": "Link content",
            "href": "#",
            "kind": "number",
            "marker-label": "1",
            "marker-icon": "placeholder-line"
          },
          "props": [
            {
              "prop": "status",
              "attr": "status"
            },
            {
              "prop": "label",
              "attr": "label"
            },
            {
              "prop": "description",
              "attr": "description",
              "if": {
                "show-description": "!false"
              }
            },
            {
              "prop": "kind",
              "attr": "kind"
            },
            {
              "prop": "icon",
              "attr": "marker-icon",
              "if": {
                "kind": "icon"
              }
            },
            {
              "prop": "markerLabel",
              "attr": "marker-label",
              "if": {
                "kind": "!icon"
              }
            },
            {
              "prop": "link",
              "attr": "link-label",
              "expr": "{ label: '{v}', href: '{@href}' }",
              "if": {
                "show-link": "!false"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "figma": [
    [
      "Orientation",
      "orientation",
      "orientation",
      "Propagada aos itens nos dois lados (no Figma, cada item é ajustado à mão)."
    ],
    [
      "Tracker",
      "(filhos)",
      "<ProgressTracker.Item>",
      "Um item por etapa, com `status` (`completed`, `current`, `pending`)."
    ],
    [
      "—",
      "current",
      "status dos itens",
      "No playground, `current` calcula os status; no React, cada item recebe o seu."
    ]
  ]
}
